---
import { site } from "@/data/site";
---

<section id="about" class="container about reveal">
  <h2 class="type-title-lg">About</h2>
  <div class="body">
    <p class="type-headline-sm">
      I came to Android through design, and it shows. I turn an idea into an app
      that <strong>looks right, feels right and holds up</strong>, from the
      first sketch to launch day.
    </p>
    <p class="type-body-md proof muted">
      I’ve built apps used by <strong>millions of people</strong> at MyTelkomsel and
      Qita. I’m the developer who catches the <strong>2dp misalignment</strong> in
      code review, and who explains the trade-offs to you in plain words.
    </p>
    <p class="type-body-sm skills muted">{site.skills.join(" · ")}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-48);
    padding-block: 80px;
  }
  h2,
  p {
    margin: 0;
  }
  h2 {
    flex: 1 1 240px;
  }
  .body {
    flex: 3 1 520px;
    min-width: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-28);
  }
  .proof {
    max-width: 680px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .proof strong {
    color: var(--color-on-surface);
    font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
  }
  .skills {
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
</style>
